WEBVTT

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:47.200
Psykick approached
us for an official match.

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:53.410
But we'll be fighting Kane and his
friends, who we met by the river one day.

00:01:53.770 --> 00:01:56.600
Takao, who couldn't believe it,
and the rest of us,

00:01:56.600 --> 00:01:59.770
snuck into their base
to see it for ourselves.

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:07.380
And to our shock, we saw them
training with the digital Sacred Beasts!

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:09.770
Kane!!

00:02:10.050 --> 00:02:11.290
Kinomiya...

00:02:21.380 --> 00:02:23.790
Go, Dragoon!

00:02:38.040 --> 00:02:39.010
What?!

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:41.040
No way!

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:42.810
Seiryu!!

00:02:45.430 --> 00:02:47.280
S-Seiryu...

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:01.500
Wait!

00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:03.080
Give Seiryu back!

00:03:03.860 --> 00:03:04.860
Kane!

00:03:04.860 --> 00:03:06.050
Guys!

00:03:06.050 --> 00:03:08.390
Seiryu belongs to us now.

00:03:13.050 --> 00:03:15.810
Kane! Hey! Wait!

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:20.210
Just a dream...

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:23.700
Darn it! I'm sick of this!

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:32.290
Let's do it.

00:03:41.290 --> 00:03:43.100
Are you okay, Takao?

00:03:43.100 --> 00:03:44.400
Where's Dragoon?

00:03:44.760 --> 00:03:47.410
Too bad. You missed.

00:03:48.030 --> 00:03:49.610
Damn!

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:52.760
What's gotten into him?

00:03:52.760 --> 00:03:55.720
Why's he trying to
change his shoot?

00:03:55.720 --> 00:03:58.500
Our match is soon, too...

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:00.350
I think that's exactly why.

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:09.250
The digital Sacred Beast we saw at the
Psykick base has gotten even stronger.

00:04:10.110 --> 00:04:16.760
The digital Sacred Beasts have been
programmed to evolve during battle.

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:19.270
Their Sacred Beasts evolve?

00:04:19.270 --> 00:04:20.330
No...

00:04:20.520 --> 00:04:27.300
We don't stand a chance against an enemy
that's constantly growing while we stay the same.

00:04:27.510 --> 00:04:29.010
That's why Takao...

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:30.900
That's not all.

00:04:31.260 --> 00:04:33.810
We're up against Kane's team.

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:39.830
They're not going to hold back.

00:04:39.830 --> 00:04:42.290
We can't just half-ass it!

00:04:43.830 --> 00:04:45.610
I don't agree.

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:48.240
Rei...

00:04:48.890 --> 00:04:51.820
If you change strategies
at the last minute,

00:04:51.820 --> 00:04:54.550
isn't that just playing
right into their hands?

00:04:54.550 --> 00:04:56.480
Are you saying we
should just lose?

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:58.020
That's not it!

00:04:58.020 --> 00:05:02.870
What I mean is that we should
fight like we've always have!

00:05:03.510 --> 00:05:06.820
We don't know if we'll
win or lose until we try.

00:05:08.180 --> 00:05:11.100
I think Rei raises a
good point, Takao.

00:05:11.560 --> 00:05:16.350
Nothing good will come from
sloppily trying to change our game plan.

00:05:16.350 --> 00:05:20.780
No! I'll do whatever
it takes to win!

00:05:20.780 --> 00:05:22.830
If we lose, that's that!

00:05:22.830 --> 00:05:25.200
They'll steal our Sacred Beasts...

00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:28.980
This is one battle we
can't afford to lose!

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:34.020
I can't watch this.

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:38.680
I think panicking before a big
battle will cause more trouble.

00:05:38.680 --> 00:05:41.130
Even for the world champion?

00:05:41.130 --> 00:05:44.710
Yeah. That just shows how much of
a threat their opponents are to them.

00:05:45.140 --> 00:05:48.600
Though I'd personally prefer
that they don't panic this much.

00:05:49.380 --> 00:05:53.280
Kyoujyu, I want you to give
this an insane tune-up.

00:05:53.810 --> 00:05:55.290
For Dragoon?

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:56.160
Yeah.

00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:58.820
You could double the Weight Disk

00:05:58.820 --> 00:06:01.410
or triple the Attack Ring!

00:06:01.410 --> 00:06:02.430
Huh?

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:04.170
You can't, Takao.

00:06:04.170 --> 00:06:06.760
Illegal modifications
are against the rules.

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:08.030
You know better.

00:06:08.030 --> 00:06:09.350
I do.

00:06:09.350 --> 00:06:11.050
So why, then?

00:06:11.050 --> 00:06:15.120
So what about Psykick? Do you think they're gonna follow the rules?

00:06:17.650 --> 00:06:23.570
It's true that the special programs
used to create the digital Sacred Beasts

00:06:23.570 --> 00:06:26.400
could be considered
illegal modifications, but...

00:06:26.710 --> 00:06:31.120
Right? If our opponents are
going to cheat, then we should--

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:32.410
Enough!

00:06:33.090 --> 00:06:35.170
I'm against this, Takao.

00:06:35.170 --> 00:06:39.150
No matter what anyone says,
I'll fight like I always have!

00:06:43.810 --> 00:06:44.910
Rei!

00:06:48.290 --> 00:06:51.410
To be honest,
I know how you feel.

00:06:52.480 --> 00:06:56.160
But this is all to
protect our Sacred Beasts.

00:06:56.720 --> 00:06:58.400
What other choice do I have?

00:07:03.760 --> 00:07:05.220
Are you sure, Takao?

00:07:05.220 --> 00:07:06.200
Yeah.

00:07:06.730 --> 00:07:09.140
I'm counting on you, Kyoujyu.

00:07:11.890 --> 00:07:13.600
They're panicking.

00:07:13.800 --> 00:07:18.720
Maybe sending them to the scientists' base had the reverse effect, Ozma?

00:07:18.720 --> 00:07:20.580
We can't be sure yet.

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:21.500
Come on.

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:22.830
Yeah...

00:07:28.420 --> 00:07:29.750
Goki, wait!

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:32.770
Are you serious, Goki?

00:07:32.770 --> 00:07:34.470
Yeah. I've made up my mind.

00:07:35.360 --> 00:07:37.270
I'll use this to fight.

00:07:37.620 --> 00:07:40.410
A Bey with a digital
Sacred Beast in it.

00:07:40.700 --> 00:07:42.470
Think about this, Goki!

00:07:42.470 --> 00:07:46.900
He's right. Have you been drawn in
by the digital Sacred Beasts as well?

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:50.090
I thought you were going
to battle your own way.

00:07:50.430 --> 00:07:52.420
My own way?

00:07:52.420 --> 00:07:55.570
That's just a load of BS.

00:07:55.570 --> 00:07:57.840
What's the point of a
battle unless you win?

00:07:58.370 --> 00:08:01.090
Power is the only
thing you can rely on!

00:08:01.570 --> 00:08:05.380
I realized that after battling Jim.

00:08:06.100 --> 00:08:08.770
Maybe you two
should think about this.

00:08:08.770 --> 00:08:12.540
Kane, Salima, the match
is just around the corner.

00:08:15.480 --> 00:08:16.600
Goki...

00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:20.320
Don't waste your breath.
Did you see his eyes?

00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:22.000
It's the same as Jim's.

00:08:28.140 --> 00:08:32.260
Ah, yes. After seeing the power
of the digital Sacred Beasts,

00:08:32.260 --> 00:08:35.050
it's weird to not  want to use it.

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:41.320
What of the other two, Doctor?

00:08:41.320 --> 00:08:42.300
Sir!

00:08:42.300 --> 00:08:47.120
Both of them already acknowledge the power of the digital Beyblades.

00:08:47.120 --> 00:08:52.260
And once we get them to abandon
their obsession with their own styles...

00:08:52.600 --> 00:08:55.550
Do you think it'll be that easy?

00:09:06.640 --> 00:09:08.500
What should I do?

00:09:09.190 --> 00:09:13.070
Will I also end up fighting with one of those digital Beyblades?

00:09:13.570 --> 00:09:14.500
I don't want to.

00:09:14.500 --> 00:09:17.540
But we were so
carefree until now...

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:20.110
--Go, Shoot!
--Go, Shoot!

00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:49.300
Now everything's changed.

00:09:54.710 --> 00:09:57.090
I don't want to
lose my Sacred Beast.

00:09:57.090 --> 00:10:01.810
But if I abandon my
style to protect it...

00:10:02.060 --> 00:10:03.810
Will I lose it myself?

00:10:04.360 --> 00:10:06.030
Or am I wrong?

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:12.050
Acknowledging each
other's strengths...

00:10:12.050 --> 00:10:15.280
to fight with
everything you've got...

00:10:15.660 --> 00:10:18.030
Is that not what a Beybattle is?

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:25.100
I-it's you!

00:10:25.540 --> 00:10:26.420
Rei...

00:10:26.690 --> 00:10:28.210
What do you want?

00:10:40.890 --> 00:10:44.710
So, while you were thinking
of that battle from earlier...

00:10:45.060 --> 00:10:46.040
Yes.

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:48.100
I just wandered here.

00:10:48.100 --> 00:10:49.530
So did I...

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:52.810
I remembered it too.

00:10:53.340 --> 00:10:55.640
Back then, Takao and Kane...

00:10:55.640 --> 00:10:59.620
enjoyed the battle without
worrying about winning or losing.

00:10:59.960 --> 00:11:01.260
Go!

00:11:09.620 --> 00:11:10.990
I won't lose!

00:11:12.050 --> 00:11:13.220
Dragoon!

00:11:16.810 --> 00:11:18.210
To think...

00:11:18.210 --> 00:11:21.430
You guys were fighting
for those scientists.

00:11:24.230 --> 00:11:25.680
I have a request.

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:27.210
Will you...

00:11:27.920 --> 00:11:30.310
forfeit the match?

00:11:30.310 --> 00:11:31.200
What?

00:11:31.940 --> 00:11:34.810
I understand that it's
an unreasonable request

00:11:34.810 --> 00:11:37.320
with the match being so soon.

00:11:37.990 --> 00:11:41.110
But I'm out of options...

00:11:41.110 --> 00:11:43.120
Hold on. I don't...

00:11:43.600 --> 00:11:48.320
You see... all this isn't what
the whole team wants.

00:11:49.380 --> 00:11:54.800
We were ordered to fight with
specially programmed Beyblades.

00:11:55.270 --> 00:11:56.800
As you're aware, I'm sure.

00:11:57.230 --> 00:11:58.930
The digital Sacred Beasts...

00:12:05.840 --> 00:12:06.790
Yes...

00:12:07.020 --> 00:12:12.680
The two of them saw the power of the digital
Sacred Beasts in the training room back then...

00:12:12.680 --> 00:12:16.340
and lost sight of their own style.

00:12:19.210 --> 00:12:23.790
What's the point of battling when you
overwhelm the opponent with pure power

00:12:23.790 --> 00:12:26.140
under the manipulation
of a Sacred Beast?

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:29.700
I can't fight a battle like that.

00:12:30.040 --> 00:12:33.280
This girl is thinking
the same thing I am...

00:12:39.070 --> 00:12:44.010
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade 2002"

00:12:44.120 --> 00:12:48.990
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade 2002"

00:12:50.240 --> 00:12:53.330
Please forfeit the match.

00:12:59.200 --> 00:13:01.620
I can't make you believe me.

00:13:01.620 --> 00:13:02.460
Huh?

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:08.000
Showing up out of nowhere
and asking you to forfeit...

00:13:08.320 --> 00:13:12.530
I figured you'd think it'd
be some kind of trap.

00:13:12.530 --> 00:13:14.000
I hadn't even...

00:13:14.840 --> 00:13:16.320
Believe me.

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:20.030
Tomorrow I'll bring proof to
you here that this isn't a trick.

00:13:20.030 --> 00:13:23.620
I will bring a Beyblade with a
digital Sacred Beast inside of it.

00:13:23.620 --> 00:13:25.090
A Beyblade?

00:13:25.090 --> 00:13:30.000
If you analyze it,
you'll learn all of its secrets.

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:32.320
And you don't mind that?

00:13:32.320 --> 00:13:36.720
In exchange, you must forfeit.
Please, convince your team.

00:13:37.310 --> 00:13:39.330
A trade...

00:13:39.330 --> 00:13:41.680
Do you accept?

00:13:44.100 --> 00:13:45.430
Understood.

00:13:45.600 --> 00:13:49.300
I have my reservations about the
direction the BBA team is going in.

00:13:50.020 --> 00:13:53.030
I don't want to go into
the match like that.

00:13:53.900 --> 00:13:55.490
You too?

00:13:56.420 --> 00:13:59.470
We'll meet here again,
at the same time tomorrow.

00:13:59.470 --> 00:14:00.420
Yes.

00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:11.210
Rei, I would love to battle you someday.
As friends, not foes.

00:14:18.450 --> 00:14:19.810
Where were you?

00:14:21.670 --> 00:14:23.300
I needed some air.

00:14:23.600 --> 00:14:25.510
I get irritated in here.

00:14:48.080 --> 00:14:51.340
What?! You want us to forfeit?!

00:14:51.340 --> 00:14:53.200
Are you serious, Rei?

00:14:53.510 --> 00:14:57.930
I don't think we can fight
fairly the way we are.

00:14:57.930 --> 00:15:02.100
You're the one who said yesterday
we that won't know until we try!

00:15:02.100 --> 00:15:04.340
Yeah! This is weird!

00:15:04.340 --> 00:15:06.980
But that might
not be a bad idea.

00:15:06.980 --> 00:15:09.380
You too, Kyoujyu?

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:13.410
I've been busy tuning up Dragoon.

00:15:13.410 --> 00:15:15.730
We could buy some time...

00:15:15.730 --> 00:15:18.230
I don't want to buy time! We forfeit!

00:15:18.230 --> 00:15:19.860
And what if we do?

00:15:20.180 --> 00:15:23.250
Do you think those
Psykicks will just give up?

00:15:23.540 --> 00:15:25.410
We know how they work,

00:15:25.410 --> 00:15:29.610
so we know they'll be
back with some cheap trick.

00:15:29.610 --> 00:15:33.300
Do you want to win even
if we break the rules, then?

00:15:33.300 --> 00:15:37.340
Is that how the world
champions fight their battles?

00:15:44.750 --> 00:15:46.290
I know how you feel, Rei.

00:15:47.440 --> 00:15:49.730
But this is our only option!

00:15:49.730 --> 00:15:52.140
Now that we've accepted,

00:15:52.140 --> 00:15:54.280
we have to fight and win!

00:16:02.850 --> 00:16:06.960
It's not like him to want to forfeit.

00:16:07.730 --> 00:16:10.030
I wonder what Rei's thinking...

00:16:10.030 --> 00:16:14.210
He had an under-the-table
deal by the river last night!

00:16:14.210 --> 00:16:16.330
By the river? What for?

00:16:16.520 --> 00:16:18.240
Beats me!

00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:20.910
What am I, his mother?

00:16:20.910 --> 00:16:25.090
I think we should keep an eye on them for a little longer, Ozma.

00:16:25.090 --> 00:16:30.590
It's possible that they're trying
to steal Byakko ahead of time.

00:16:30.590 --> 00:16:32.090
Stay alert.

00:16:57.250 --> 00:16:59.140
Put that Beyblade back.

00:17:06.450 --> 00:17:08.900
Meeting with someone?

00:17:12.650 --> 00:17:15.350
Her name is Salima.

00:17:15.350 --> 00:17:19.400
I thought we understood each other.

00:17:19.860 --> 00:17:23.570
Just like how I feel about Takao,

00:17:23.570 --> 00:17:29.110
she hated how her best friends were getting
drawn in by the digital Sacred Beasts...

00:17:29.270 --> 00:17:30.310
Which is why I...

00:17:30.310 --> 00:17:32.590
You're wasting your time.

00:17:33.330 --> 00:17:34.230
What?

00:17:34.230 --> 00:17:39.800
What do you think happens to a Blader who gets their
hands on a Sacred Beast if they're not ready for it?

00:17:39.800 --> 00:17:41.520
You saw it.

00:17:50.260 --> 00:17:51.690
You mean Yuya...

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:53.680
There's no going back.

00:17:54.030 --> 00:17:56.180
Not while they're still around.

00:17:56.180 --> 00:17:59.520
So she'll fall victim to
the Sacred Beasts as well?

00:17:59.520 --> 00:18:03.400
Yeah. That's why we
have to fight them.

00:18:03.660 --> 00:18:06.490
But I could never modify
my Bey like Takao--

00:18:06.490 --> 00:18:08.610
Do whatever you want.

00:18:08.610 --> 00:18:09.310
Huh?

00:18:09.670 --> 00:18:14.400
I'll do whatever it takes to
beat whoever did this to Yuya.

00:18:15.520 --> 00:18:19.620
Well, you can fight
in your own way.

00:18:19.620 --> 00:18:21.300
Think about it.

00:18:22.720 --> 00:18:24.420
In my own way...

00:18:27.630 --> 00:18:30.310
You've got the wrong idea, Salima.

00:18:30.690 --> 00:18:31.330
What?

00:18:31.570 --> 00:18:36.910
Making Kinomiya's team forfeit
won't solve the problem.

00:18:38.030 --> 00:18:41.920
If you want to open Jim and
Goki's eyes to the truth,

00:18:41.920 --> 00:18:45.490
you should be doing the opposite.

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:47.510
The opposite?

00:18:48.250 --> 00:18:53.170
We have to master the Beyblades with the digital Sacred Beasts.

00:18:53.170 --> 00:18:54.000
What?

00:18:54.540 --> 00:18:58.180
And not used by the Sacred
Beasts like Jim and Goki are.

00:18:58.180 --> 00:19:00.960
But to really master the
Sacred Beast and the Bey.

00:19:00.960 --> 00:19:06.410
That way, we can battle them
just the way we want to.

00:19:06.720 --> 00:19:09.620
Master the Sacred Beast and the Bey...

00:19:10.180 --> 00:19:11.090
Yeah.

00:19:12.770 --> 00:19:13.700
Kane...

00:19:14.610 --> 00:19:17.700
Now stop being so foolish.

00:19:17.950 --> 00:19:19.210
Hand over that Bey.

00:19:26.490 --> 00:19:27.500
Rei...

00:19:32.460 --> 00:19:34.600
She didn't show up, huh...

00:19:36.340 --> 00:19:37.620
I get it now, Kai.

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:41.120
We have to fight, after all.

00:19:47.930 --> 00:19:51.180
Finally decided to use
our digital Beyblades?

00:19:51.550 --> 00:19:53.660
Kept us waiting, you two.

00:19:53.660 --> 00:19:54.970
Let's give 'em a fight.

00:19:54.970 --> 00:19:56.200
Yeah.

00:19:58.450 --> 00:20:02.210
The preparations are complete, Mr. Gideon.

00:20:02.210 --> 00:20:04.710
Now we just wait for
the day of the match.

00:20:05.520 --> 00:20:08.540
Give them their final training.

00:20:08.540 --> 00:20:09.490
Yes, sir!

00:20:09.990 --> 00:20:12.890
Training starts now!

00:20:16.420 --> 00:20:17.550
Three!

00:20:17.550 --> 00:20:18.450
Two!

00:20:18.450 --> 00:20:19.330
One!

00:20:19.330 --> 00:20:20.690
Go, Shoot!

00:20:42.910 --> 00:20:44.170
Go!

00:20:44.170 --> 00:20:45.340
Crush it!

00:20:45.340 --> 00:20:46.750
That's the spirit!

00:20:46.750 --> 00:20:51.890
You will memorize the BBA team's style and the abilities of their Sacred Beasts

00:20:52.180 --> 00:20:55.810
down to the very last detail.

00:20:58.480 --> 00:21:03.550
Listen up. If you don't take this as seriously
as the real thing, the practice is pointless.

00:21:03.550 --> 00:21:07.120
Shaddup, Hiromi.
We know that!

00:21:07.120 --> 00:21:09.620
Come on! I'm
trying to help here!

00:21:15.470 --> 00:21:16.630
Rei...!

00:21:17.090 --> 00:21:19.620
We don't have
long until the match.

00:21:19.990 --> 00:21:21.120
Which means...

00:21:21.700 --> 00:21:23.620
I'm in, Takao!

00:21:24.180 --> 00:21:25.250
Yeah!

00:22:59.010 --> 00:23:02.690
It's the day before the
battle with Kane's team.

00:23:02.690 --> 00:23:05.710
I made some powerful
modifications to Dragoon,

00:23:05.710 --> 00:23:10.180
But can we really beat the digital
Sacred Beast's incredible power this way?

00:23:10.180 --> 00:23:12.820
We have no choice, Chairman!

00:23:12.820 --> 00:23:15.140
We at least<b> want the
Sacred Beasts to feast!</b>

00:23:15.140 --> 00:23:17.860
What? "I don't get it"?

00:23:17.860 --> 00:23:19.540
Neither do I!

00:23:19.540 --> 00:23:22.270
